          "overview": "The star-studded casts of the drama series come together for the highly anticipated movie adaptation of \"Doctor X\"! The secret of Michiko Daimon is finally revealed. \"I never fail.\" How was the solitary surgeon Michiko Daimon born? What is the dark and mysterious tumultuous half-life of Michiko?",
